{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11105020","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11105020","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1110502001:1":{"text":"A tightly closed door with two stone slabs in front of it...","source_cn":"一扇紧闭的门，门前有两块石板……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x410C4F1E9978AB96","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1110502002:1":{"text":"Hmm... These slabs look like they could be pressed down with something heavy. Should we try standing on them?","source_cn":"石板的边缘微微高出地面，看起来能被重物压下去……我们站...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x25C926B8B16670A5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1110502003:1":{"text":"Alsa, be careful!","source_cn":"阿尔萨，小心一点！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x15B692E50BCFF7FA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1110502004:1":{"text":"Nothing happened, you worrywart! But I have an idea.","source_cn":"看，无事发生！不过站上去之后，确实能感到石板下有升降机关……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9445649CF29031AC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1110502005:1":{"text":"Seth, I know we're competitors, but would you stand on the other slab for a second?","source_cn":"赛特斯大人，虽然是对手——不过，能请您站到另一块石板上去吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3D96B827F3208541","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1110502006:1":{"text":"Don't tell me what to do.","source_cn":"别命令我。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x69D91521D44C545F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1110502007:1":{"text":"I'm not! I'm just saying, Mikola hinted that teamwork might be the ticket here. It wouldn't hurt to try, right?","source_cn":"我并不想，也无法强迫您。只是，曼卡拉提示要我们双方合作...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6DD4BF788551941D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:10:1110502007":{"text":"I'm not! I'm just saying, Mikola hinted that teamwork might be the ticket here. It wouldn't hurt to try, right?","source_cn":"我并不想，也无法强迫您。只是，曼卡拉提示要我们双方合作才能通过试炼，尝试一次，对您也没什么损失吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6DD4BF788551941D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1110502008:1":{"text":"I trust Alsa's instincts in situations like this. I hope you will too.","source_cn":"我赞成阿尔萨的判断。每当这种时候，她的直觉都值得信赖。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x663B0E3A2388A5E8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1110502010:1":{"text":"Trust you? Dream on. We're rivals right now.","source_cn":"要我信任你们？别异想天开了。我们可是对手——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA196A7687CF78DE0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1110502011:1":{"text":"What my years in battle have taught me is that you never do what your enemy expects.","source_cn":"多年的战斗教会我什么，那就是——绝不要做敌人希望你做的事。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x27446B212832B68F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1110502012:1":{"text":"I'll find another way. Good luck, I'll see you at the finish line.","source_cn":"我会另寻出路。你们，自求多福吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA8B19243492C09BE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:10:0:1":{"text":"It's a good idea.","source_cn":"有道理","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xA10ECE5F5A15AB21","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"It's a good idea.","female":"It's a good idea.","variant_male_record_index":"63088","variant_female_record_index":"63089","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1110502009:1":{"text":"True, but it's just the first hurdle. If Mikola's hint is true, we should trust Alsa's judgment.","source_cn":"的确，但这只是第一道关口，如果曼卡拉的提示不是误导，我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFADB0872A5E859E4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:10:1:2":{"text":"It might be dangerous.","source_cn":"可能有危险","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x045314F3928EE671","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"It might be dangerous.","female":"It might be dangerous.","variant_male_record_index":"63090","variant_female_record_index":"63091","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:索恩":{"text":"Soren","source":"索恩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:阿尔萨":{"text":"Alsa","source":"阿尔萨","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:赛特斯":{"text":"Seth","source":"赛特斯","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":16,"localized_text_count":15,"speaker_count":3}}